First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}-2X-5 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}-2X-5I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(C)={C}^{2}-2C-5I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${C}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}^{2} & =C\\cdot C \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(C):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(C) & ={C}^{2}-2C-5I \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 7\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-5\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 7\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7-2-5 & 4-4-0 \\\\ 6-6-0 & 7-2-5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265932 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "044dd086-544e-5ed7-b2bf-067b8139ed0d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -3 \\\\ 3 & -8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263040} {:answer/id #uuid "58dba737-3a25-5e68-8e16-f1ffb240c94a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 3 \\\\ -3 & -8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263764} {:answer/id #uuid "845187ca-1829-5e76-9568-0bdaef276cc8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 3 \\\\ -3 & -5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264135} {:answer/id #uuid "af09facc-4fa4-58eb-8bb1-5c2c400dba0e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 5 \\\\ -3 & -8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #ed