tion/id #uuid "b47ca15a-ddfb-5bef-bdaa-d65e81339106" :question/math-academy-id "q-279430" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $F=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.$ Find ${F}^{3}.$\n\n| ${F}^{3}=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, to find ${F}^{2},$ we multiply $F$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{F}^{2} & =F\\cdot F \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since ${F}^{3}={F}^{2}\\cdot F,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{F}^{3} & ={F}^{2}\\cdot F \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & 36 \\\\ 18 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295069 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "254cd680-7474-5d51-b43c-ca853e1850b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "65" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293094}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "254cd680-7474-5d51-b43c-ca853e1850b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "65" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293094} :answer-field/id #uuid "09b1de6a-f6bb-599b-b7ff-78dbd51488e1" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293957} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d6d30399-2735-5f6f-8ef4-b699a15e54b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-49" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293764}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d6d30399-2735-5f6f-8ef4-b699a15e54b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-49" :db/id #edb/r