={X}^{2}+I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(A)={A}^{2}+I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${A}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{2} & =A\\cdot A \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(A):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(A) & ={A}^{2}+I \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1+1 & 0+0 \\\\ 0+0 & -1+1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295081 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25a741d8-d805-57c3-8eaa-5ecef1b3a0ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293096}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "25a741d8-d805-57c3-8eaa-5ecef1b3a0ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293096} :answer-field/id #uuid "632bc6b6-c108-51f2-b004-14e93510b50a" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294282} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "685532a8-90a1-5df3-93e7-241442d63017" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "18" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293366}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "685532a8-90a1-5df3-93e7-241442d63017" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "18" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293366} :answer-field/id #uuid "6f1b6f21-ebdd-5a30-b1c8-5acccaf74033" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294320} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5496ad78-503c-50d7-a729-8c21a4ed9ac2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293277}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5496ad78-503c-50d7-a729-8c21a4ed9ac2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293277} :answer-field/id #uuid "9c1eee9e-2f3b-5beb-8145-682bbbe23882" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294492} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9072df32-a4c2-5b20-94e4-c5af28f58d93" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293492}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9072df32-a4c2-5b20-94e4-c5af28f58d93" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293492} :answer-field/id #uuid "dabf682b-6cfa-5397-8e38-bc244bce618c" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294697}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "917f8f63-b26b-504b-a285-9ba098bf725e" :question/math-academy-id "q-279495" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $H=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$ If $f(X)={X}^{2}+3X+2$, find $f(H).$\n\n| $f(H)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}+3X+2 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}+3X+2I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(H)={H}^{2}+3H+2I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${H}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{H}^{2} & =H\\cdot H \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -3 \\\\ 6 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(H):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(H) & ={H}^{2}+3H+2I \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -3 \\\\ 6 & -2\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -3 \\\\ 6 & -2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}9 & -3 \\\\ 6 & 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7+9+2 & -3+(-3)+0 \\\\ 6+6+0 & -2+0+2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}18 & -6 \\\\ 12 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295082 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1edaad23-38fa-5ade-914e-a5609242b3e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293058}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1edaad23-38fa-5ade-914e-a5609242b3e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293058} :answer-field/id #uuid "37055139-282b-539d-b483-a56f37aed491" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294119} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "803d37e6-0041-5d63-9b2b-b08db1050ece" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293448}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "803d37e6-0041-5d63-9b2b-b08db1050ece" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293448} :answer-field/id #uuid "4e87e3ce-d69f-57ca-803b-5cbeb952b948" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294206} {:answer-field/choices [{:an