-279506" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $E=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.$ If $f(X)={X}^{2}+4X-5$, find $f(E).$\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">$f(E)=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-3}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">\n{{field-4}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}+4X-5 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}+4X-5I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(E)={E}^{2}+4E-5I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${E}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{E}^{2} & =E\\cdot E \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(E):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(E) & ={E}^{2}+4E-5I \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}+4\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-5\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4+8-5 & 0+0-0 \\\\ 3+4-0 & 1+4-5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186366302 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "22d7958c-94ba-5de3-9243-e30601f76543" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ -5 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366304} {:answer/id #uuid "b10801ca-f13a-57ad-8038-3828133145ba" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366305} {:answer/id #uuid "e55ee6b6-6cbe-5ecc-a66b-628ac43bc811" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366306} {:answer/id #uuid "1a296f4e-0f9b-50c7-9b4e-bd01d0b60375" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366307} {:answer/id #uuid "eba229a2-1a77-552c-9266-524a1d9a221b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366308}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "eba229a2-1a77-552c-9266-524a1d9a221b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366308} :answer-field/id #uuid "de3f2328-fa8d-5da1-9c29-ab9566101429" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366303}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "2869021c-9120-59a9-9952-6f0d251d0602" :question/math-academy-id "q-78347" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.$  Find $f(B)$ if $f(X)={X}^{2}+X+3.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}+X+3 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}+X+3I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(B)={B}^{2}+B+3I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${B}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{B}^{2} & =B\\cdot B \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(B):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(B) & ={B}^{2}+B+3I \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0+2+3 & 0+1+0 \\\\ 0+(-4)+0 & 0+(-2)+3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186366309 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "afe8d6d8-0a6d-5efd-a9c0-c468f00d3f21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 5 \\\\ -15 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366311} {:answer/id #uuid "d25a56e7-16c2-5f88-992b-3343761aa97c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}29 & 5 \\\\ -5 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366312} {:answer/id #uuid "e3f3e7d5-a5eb-5b88-94d1-ab28c0dfcffd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}29 & 5 \\\\ -15 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366313} {:answer/id #uuid "8d63f40b-f2ea-5001-ae5e-ff191217dc44" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}29 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366314} {:answer/id #uuid "eb627ab1-f604-5f7b-aa59-eecf1c4e4f64" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 9 \\\\ -15 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366315}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e3f3e