n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{U}^{2} & =U\\cdot U \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since ${U}^{3}={U}^{2}\\cdot U,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{U}^{3} & ={U}^{2}\\cdot U \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 24 \\\\ -24 & -8\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186388132 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "67b616c2-ce6e-5c95-8648-dd89dbfaa3f6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ 6 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388134} {:answer/id #uuid "ca63b17e-8661-5864-bf17-dbc1f35dc340" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 6 \\\\ 9 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388135} {:answer/id #uuid "5cae900f-3b80-52ed-97df-eae2af51f956" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -6 \\\\ 9 & -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388136} {:answer/id #uuid "8a887fa4-9ae0-5c2c-ac17-c0d680bda859" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -3 \\\\ 9 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388137} {:answer/id #uuid "de5ea921-ae36-5369-bf56-d02193f5bc68" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 6 \\\\ -6 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388138}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ca63b17e-8661-5864-bf17-dbc1f35dc340" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 6 \\\\ 9 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388135} :answer-field/id #uuid "889964a6-0e86-53e7-a015-8ff79199c498" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388133}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "01490c7d-4c84-5d6b-914b-a1fab67bc26a" :question/math-academy-id "q-130681" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.$  Find $f(A)$ if $f(X)={X}^{2}-2X-8.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}-2X-8 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}-2X-8I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(A)={A}^{2}-2A-8I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${A}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{2} & =A\\cdot A \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 10 \\\\ 15 & 22\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(A):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(A) & ={A}^{2}-2A-8I \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 10 \\\\ 15 & 22\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}-8\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 10 \\\\ 15 & 22\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -4 \\\\ -6 & -8\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7-2-8 & 10-4+0 \\\\ 15-6+0 & 22-8-8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 6 \\\\ 9 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186388139 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7c29b720-4600-5452-856a-0de6c5b2cbbc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388141} {:answer/id #uuid "d78e56c2-19a5-58bf-aac5-d59f602172e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388142} {:answer/id #uuid "b2514912-db4d-511d-a89d-093ae0777083" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388143} {:answer/id #uuid "d3f1a29c-c2ff-5901-b277-ceaff0eb220f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388144} {:answer/id #uuid "adc7ac7b-e40f-5c06-9fee-5b824b5729d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388145}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "adc7ac7b-e40f-5c06-9fee-5b824b5729d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388145} :answer-field/id #uuid "5decefa1-878b-5a33-98d2-b1ec4d4f6078" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388140}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "6097bb1d-9d7a-56b4-9d4d-09d460a9e165" :question/math-academy-id "q-130687" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $C=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.$ Find $f(C)$ if $f(X)={X}^{2}-X+5.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}-X+5 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}-X+5I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(C)={C}^{2}-C+5I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${C}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}^{2} & =C\\cdot C \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(C):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(C) & ={C}^{2}-C+5I \\\\  & =C-C+5I \\\\  & =5I \\\\  & =5\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186388146 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "98d46de3-1964-521e-987f-3f87e63d14f6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388148} {:answer/id #uuid "290eb367-b69e-51e9-b010-dd7d2e86e6ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388149} {:answer/id #uuid "8ec94462-c5a9-5b19-af43-e4fb15a1b17d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 \\\\ 12 & 7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388150} {:answer/id #uuid "def69761-fa9a-5675-91a9-81ca5a36b65a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388151} {:answer/id #uuid "cdeec92a-fd20-575e-a12b-6d715aa8a4a0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 4 \\\\ 12 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388152}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "290eb367-b69e-51e9-b010-dd7d2e86e6ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388149} :answer-field/id #uuid "56b6390d-ed7e-571e-81e8-62f931b08ef6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388147}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "22954632-a7ef-5551-8cda-37dd0def8e71" :question/math-academy-id "q-130688" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $K=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.$ Find $f(K)$ if $f(X)={X}^{2}-4X+1.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}-4X+1 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}-4X+I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(K)={K}^{2}-4K+I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${K}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{K}^{2} & =K\\cdot K \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 \\\\ 12 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(K):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(K) & ={K}^{2}-4K+I \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 \\\\ 12 & 7\\end{bmatrix}-4\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 \\\\ 12 & 7\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 4 \\\\ 12 & 8\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7-8+1 & 4-4-0 \\\\ 12-12+0 & 7-8+1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186393863 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d718e860-d9b8-5907-8e53-05046524911e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 12 \\\\ 14 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393865} {:answer/id #uuid "0b2da8db-419b-5fc2-a2f6-c5d25d2ee8d2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186393866} {:answer/id #uuid "6f8c7ef1-9d5b-59ed-9bfc-b71aaba92cbf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 12 \\\