\ 3 & -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.$ Find ${B}^{2}.$\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"3\">${B}^{2}=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-3}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-4}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">$11$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-5}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "To find ${B}^{2},$ we multiply $B$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{B}^{2} & =B\\cdot B \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 11 & -3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186486453 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25168437-2aa4-5977-952c-2051730ceff6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 4 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485826} {:answer/id #uuid "5b213e2b-cc6d-508a-a15f-3bf22cc91d0d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ 4 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485924} {:answer/id #uuid "8b991cf9-c833-51b6-a70c-6462ead85a65" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186486013} {:answer/id #uuid "caf9fadd-4204-560a-bbdd-f5a3d57450f4" :answer/t