x}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+3-1 & 0-2+0 \\\\ 0+4+0 & 1-3-1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ 4 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186604585 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29db0dc6-d441-5d4b-bdd6-7056a72eab43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-10 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604253} {:answer/id #uuid "5c2f1d3d-5ae8-58a5-8527-f854e40bc5b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-10 & 18 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604313} {:answer/id #uuid "a4cd98ba-a4a0-5733-b236-6b9819eafcc8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-26 & 18 \\\\ 27 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604389} {:answer/id #uuid "c2fb4363-d906-5d63-b8f5-ca5ece22e23d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-26 & 18 \\\\ -3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604416} {:answer/id #uuid "f64eef86-9144-52f3-88b0-259695e36555" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-26 & -2 \\\\ 27 & 7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604466}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a4cd98ba-a4a0-5733-b236-6b9819eafcc8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-26 & 18 \\\\ 27 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604389} :answer-field/id #uuid "b13dac53-37a8-5fdf-a5b9-20114b11adce" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604533}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "47f77f53-d24f-5514-bb7f-871f8600f6ee" :question/math-academy-id "q-78339" :question/problem "If $C=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$, then ${C}^{3}=$" :question/worked-solution "First, to find ${C}^{2},$ we multiply $C$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}^{2} & =C\\cdot C \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}10 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since ${C}^{3}={C}^{2}\\cdot C,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}^{3} & ={C}^{2}\\cdot C \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}10 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-26 & 18 \\\\ 27 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186604603 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "74a4e0bb-8be7-5675-945d-4003346724fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 11\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604341} {:answer/id #uuid "8fbe6e62-1620-5098-8969-1da2bc1e6cfc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 11\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604367} {:answer/id #uuid "968e5c8a-f105-5a30-bccf-872b80ecde0a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604376} {:answer/id #uuid "d28f8ccc-3c8c-5a55-8d75-2167aa088d46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604429} {:answer/id #uuid "d6563758-4ad7-5d32-8efa-1e0f223da9c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186604433}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "74a4e0bb-8be7-56