dent :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628772} :answer-field/id #uuid "e6c9e9b2-f76d-54e4-b7e6-b4308a35f5ed" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629238}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "43ff301f-7fa9-522b-9191-9365c52a3db0" :question/math-academy-id "q-279442" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $G=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.$ Find ${G}^{4}.$\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">${G}^{4}=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-3}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">\n{{field-4}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "First, to find ${G}^{2},$ we multiply $G$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{G}^{2} & =G\\cdot G \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since ${G}^{4}={G}^{2}\\cdot {G}^{2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{G}^{4} & ={G}^{2}\\cdot {G}^{2} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 4 \\\\ -8 & -7\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186629295 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08f9aaf4-f969-5910-8c14-95e44449fcb9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 6 \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628721} {:answer/id #uuid "2ca45530-e63a-50cd-aea3-d3e099aa9827" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628784} {:answer/id #uuid "a97f1054-af45-5eba-9516-602ac2550d97" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628992} {:answer/id #uuid "bdfaad02-e20f-5368-aac2-640dad550c1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 2 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629030} {:answer/id #uuid "d9382f72-e4a3-5e0e-9ef4-3259b1add9f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 6 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629075}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d9382f72-e4a3-5e0e-9ef4-3259b1add9f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 6 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629075} :answer-field/id #uuid "fa0d0c10-ebf4-5e54-a543-726fbf684184" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629248}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "65a535f8-d2d6-5fd1-82b7-5cf3569ca751" :question/math-academy-id "q-130669" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.$  Find $f(B)$ if $f(X)={X}^{2}+3X-4.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}+3X-4 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}+3X-4I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(B)={B}^{2}+3B-4I.$ \n\nLet's calculate ${B}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{B}^{2} & =B\\cdot B \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(B):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(B) & ={B}^{2}+3B-4I \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}-4\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 6 & -3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3+3-4 & 0+3+0 \\\\ 0+6+0 & 3-3-4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 6 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186629309 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0856b871-0665-5614-bffc-692aa7a91cbf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}11 & 10 \\\\ -15 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628720} {:answer/id #uuid "627ee62a-5db2-5077-b133-e78d07d3bea7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}10 & 11 \\\\ -15 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628875} {:answer/id #uuid "875825ab-c974-5c20-981b-2b7e3fe64542" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}11 & 16 \\\\ -15 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628937} {:answer/id #uuid "c606bf37-3c0d-5a95-8ba4-1968867cbbc8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}11 & 10 \\\\ -16 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629041} {:answer/id #uuid "f5765fb7-81b8-515f-beba-48c107fee636" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-15 & 10 \\\\ 11 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629118}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0856b871-0665-5614-bffc-692aa7a91cbf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}11 & 10 \\\\ -15 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628720} :answer-field/id #uuid "8d7298e0-647c-5293-be5a-8257e72f0cff" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629191}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "82f52676-5e6a-5fb8-b917-230ddfc7b240" :question/math-academy-id "q-78498" :question/problem "If $T=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$, then ${T}^{3}=$" :question/worked-solution "First, to find ${T}^{2},$ we multiply $T$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{2} & =T\\cdot T \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since ${T}^{3}={T}^{2}\\cdot T,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{3} & ={T}^{2}\\cdot T \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}11 & 10 \\\\ -15 & 6\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186629314 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0392002c-23ce-5cac-a4a3-7716bf5bf575" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628703} {:answer/id #uuid "3a12e9f4-e5c9-56cd-8c19-5cc023af04e7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628808} {:answer/id #uuid "3a3e4210-6725-52db-b4ca-dc8d937ed32e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628809} {:answer/id #uuid "d654bf76-ccc4-5fc2-8541-762025c4e018" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629066} {:answer/id #uuid "ead83a68-7722-556f-8dfe-0d664f71774c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629102}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0392002c-23ce-5cac-a4a3-7716bf5bf575" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628703} :answer-field/id #uuid "29d50628-6f78-5790-a664-536c044aaa40" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629154}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "914fdcff-4feb-54fc-9e73-543b7c3b4269" :question/math-academy-id "q-78346" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $A=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.$  Find $f(A)$ if $f(X)={X}^{2}-X+1.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}-X+1 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}-X+I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(A)={A}^{2}-A+I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${A}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{2} & =A\\cdot A \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(A):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(A) & ={A}^{2}-A+I \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2+2+1 & -3+3+0 \\\\ 2+(-2)+0 & 3+(-3)+1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186629327 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ca1ccbbe-4763-5abc-90a8-57b33948706a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629048}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ca1ccbbe-4763-5abc-90a8-57b33948706a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629048} :answer-field/id #uuid "4b4aa99d-d180-57b7-9800-2a9dbef25cef" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629168} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8b7b7d72-716c-5424-bed0-c89bc4a7f65f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628940}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8b7b7d72-716c-5424-bed0-c89bc4a7f65f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628940} :answer-field/id #uuid "6b28829f-bc99-501e-80fa-039826ceaf58" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629181} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "da7f14bb-681b-54ee-af74-f6ffad641073" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629076}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "da7f14bb-681b-54ee-af74-f6ffad641073" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186629076} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb5