 $B^4=B^2\\cdot B^2$, square the result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B^4 &= \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}0\\cdot0+3\\cdot(-3) & 0\\cdot3+3\\cdot3 \\\\ (-3)\\cdot0+3\\cdot(-3) & (-3)\\cdot3+3\\cdot3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}-9 & 9 \\\\ -9 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719544 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0401877c-e91c-59f1-b9c4-ddb54e5a0d75" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719532} {:answer/id #uuid "4c6e3d91-ade3-549a-a349-acb7b930e89c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719541} {:answer/id #uuid "98f76efe-4faf-59ac-abd8-f0d3f00256fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719550} {:answer/id #uuid "f6c3dc16-64e9-56e2-a931-81869da631a0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719555} {:answer/id #uuid "f6eac5b7-1a3d-5a07-8c7b-641b957158f6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719556}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "98f76efe-4faf-59ac-abd8-f0d3f00256fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719550} :answer-field/id #uuid "13c3e1a0-254e-585b-99c2-812a22089d76" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719535}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "738e91ea-6e61-52c2-8e72-aeef05aefec5" :question/problem "If $A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$, then $A^2=$" :question/worked-solution "To find $A^2$, multiply $A$ by itself using row-by-column products:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A^2 &= A\\cdot A \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}1\\cdot1+2\\cdot(-1) & 1\\cdot2+2\\cdot0 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot1+0\\cdot(-1) & (-1)\\cdot2+0\\cdot0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe exponent counts matrix factors; it does not square each entry."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719547 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f8c74226-9ee1-5d5f-8591-90a7211c46aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719557}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f8c74226-9ee1-5d5f-8591-90a7211c46aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719557} :answer-field/id #uuid "40fecbe7-cb66-5bfc-832e-e04af7b67a38" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719539} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fc4747ca-0284-5195-ac57-aee0dff3f892" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719558}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fc4747ca-0284-5195-ac57-aee0dff3f892" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719558} :answer-field/id #uuid "7b744691-c710-5513-845d-89977ef2df24" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #